      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرْزٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرْزَةٌ</span>, in two places: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْزَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Accord. to Lth, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفِرْزُ</span> is syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَرْدُ</span>;
but this is disallowed by Az. (TA.)

